flowchart LR
  subgraph Client[浏览器]
    UI[页面和阅读观察]
    Decode[WebP 浏览器 Worker / WASM]
    UI --> Decode
  end
  Scheduler[scheduler] -->|内部 Token / tick| App
  Hook[扫描 Webhook] -->|扫描 Token| App
  App[Next.js Web / API 控制面] <-->|领域与任务事务| DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  UI -->|认证会话| App
  subgraph Backend[一个服务端 Worker 进程]
    Resolve[解析 Dispatcher / 并发 1]
    Download[下载 Dispatcher / 并发 1]
    Writer[写入 Dispatcher / 并发 1]
  end
  Resolve <-->|claim / fence / checkpoint| DB
  Download <-->|claim / fence / checkpoint / seal| DB
  Writer <-->|claim / fence / publication| DB
  Resolve -->|受 Provider governor 限制| Remote[远端来源]
  Download -->|受 Provider governor 限制| Remote
  Download -->|隔离 generation 写入和全量校验| Staging[(归档 staging)]
  Staging -->|封存 manifest 原子交接| Writer
  Writer -->|归档发布与其他媒体写入| Media[(原媒体 / 归档 revision)]
  Writer -->|生成| Derived[(派生媒体)]
  Writer <-->|读写| Snapshot[(Pixiv 来源快照)]
  App -->|认证读取 / 原媒体默认只读| Media
  App -.->|显式允许写挂载时：上传 / 替换 / 章节写入| Media
  App <-->|读取 / 可写挂载| Derived
  App -->|只读| Snapshot
  FileBoundary[writer lane 仅串行 SystemJob<br/>App 直接文件写入不在该队列<br/>数据库 fence 不回滚文件 I/O]
  FileBoundary -.-> App
  FileBoundary -.-> Writer
  UI --> Img[ImgProxy]
  Img -->|只读挂载| Media
  Img -->|只读挂载| Derived
  Decode -->|同源媒体请求| App
